      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Mr. Adrian, the Archive Integrity Commission (AIC) requires your immediate
    engagement for highly sensitive file integrity cases. Your operational procedure
    is simple and non-negotiable, acting as the foundation for your engagement with
    us:\n1. Case Intake: Review the Client Request email and open the attached corrupt
    file via the secure terminal.\n2. Anomaly Isolation: Utilize the provided tools
    to edit the file, precisely locating and isolating the embedded archival anomaly.\n3.
    AIC Resolution: Complete and submit the official AIC Resolution Form, detailing
    the anomaly and your findings.\n4. Client Block: Immediately execute the 'External
    Communication Block' against the corresponding client channel to terminate contact.\nWe
    know your background\u2014the stress from your father\u2019s accident and the
    insufficient stability of your freelance work. Your immediate assignment briefing
    and secure rendezvous point (coordinates: #########) are attached. Failure to
    accept this mandate, Adrian, will result in consequences that compromise the
    fragile life you currently maintain. Join the AIC, or face the consequences of
    inaction."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
